{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit"],"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The app makes one where it starts, from the decisions it saved, gives it to its tracker, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"updates it as the user decides:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let consent = Consent([.analytics: .granted])","let tracker = Tracker(consent: consent)","\/\/ Later, from the consent prompt:","consent.grant(.advertising)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each event is gated by its type’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event.consentCategory"},{"text":", by the decisions made before it was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Granted:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" delivered as any event is, written to the tracker’s store first if it has one."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Undecided:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" held in memory, and not written to the store, until the category is decided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Granting it delivers its held events in the order they were tracked, before any event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked after the grant; denying it drops them, reported on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The hold keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at most "},{"code":"heldRecordLimit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" events across every category and tracker: when it is full, its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"oldest is dropped to make room, reported as it happens (merged with the overflow reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not yet read). Held events are lost if the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends first."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Denied:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" dropped, and not collected at all, so not reported.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Records a store recovered from an earlier run are gated again as the tracker starts, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent may have changed since. One whose category is now denied is dropped, reported and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forgotten by the store. One whose category is undecided is held outside the bound, still kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the store, so a full hold never drops it; if the app ends first, it is gated again on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next launch. One the store drops for its own byte bound while held is reported by the store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and still delivered if granted in this run, as a record a delivery has already read is.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A category not given a status is undecided. Withdrawing consent is a denial: records the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker had already let through when it was granted are still delivered."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share one set of decisions and one hold. A decision returns at once, from any thread:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it records the status, which "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns from then on, and queues the decision"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for each tracker given the consent, whose own worker releases or drops what it held. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker reports its own drops."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentStatus","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/NegativeHeldRecordLimit"],"title":"Consent","anchor":"Consent","generated":true}],"relationshipsSections":[{"id